{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dust &amp; Dice, you build your deck, roll the dice to determine your fate, and battle in turn-based duels that require both skill and luck. Immerse yourself in a world of dusty enemies and dangerous duels, where your luck at the dice table and your strategic acumen determine life and death.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944240?t=1763458420","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944240?t=1763458420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/2903ce25a4fdad5026348d338b65eba7eb920cc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763458420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/2903ce25a4fdad5026348d338b65eba7eb920cc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763458420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Fortune has a Price!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/d55c683cf5bb1f6ec9dd1e9643d1d362.poster.avif?t=1763458420\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/d55c683cf5bb1f6ec9dd1e9643d1d362.webm?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/d55c683cf5bb1f6ec9dd1e9643d1d362.mp4?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll your dice to get chips. The value of each die is converted into chips, which you can use strategically to attack your opponent or defend yourself with a shield.</p></p><br><h1>The road to showdown</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/694e1e2cc8393d875eb271955c4332ad.avif?t=1763458420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras_big/694e1e2cc8393d875eb271955c4332ad.avif?t=1763458420 width=1600 height=2844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new adventure on our randomly generated map! Fight your way through sections full of scoundrels of every weight class, spend your chips in the shady shop, or put the finishing touches on your cards in the Forge House. Prepare yourself well, because at the end, only the nastiest boss in the desert awaits you. Who knows what crazy dangers you'll encounter along the way?</p></p><br><h1>Roll for Power </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/5b8a6e747fbee0e06452837629295cf2.poster.avif?t=1763458420\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/5b8a6e747fbee0e06452837629295cf2.webm?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/5b8a6e747fbee0e06452837629295cf2.mp4?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just rely on luck. Collect unique special dice that bend the rules of the game with powerful abilities and surprising effects.</p></p><br><h1>Prove Your Mettle</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/a344d964581263753728efdd969c9d7c.poster.avif?t=1763458420\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/a344d964581263753728efdd969c9d7c.webm?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/a344d964581263753728efdd969c9d7c.mp4?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay your enemies, claim your victory, and prepare for what lies ahead. If you're skilled enough, you might just survive.</p></p><br><h1>Upgrade your Cards!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/f061f658166427e115490cd1117ad852.poster.avif?t=1763458420\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/f061f658166427e115490cd1117ad852.webm?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/f061f658166427e115490cd1117ad852.mp4?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the \u201cForge House,\u201d you can select a card from your current deck and permanently upgrade it. Strategically upgrading your cards allows you to deepen synergies and prepare for the tougher duels that lie ahead.</p></p><br><h1>Break &amp; Planning</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/18445d6cebf477045afeaeb5b5ff70ec.poster.avif?t=1763458420\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/18445d6cebf477045afeaeb5b5ff70ec.webm?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/18445d6cebf477045afeaeb5b5ff70ec.mp4?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find a moment of peace by the campfire. Here you can recharge your batteries and heal your wounds. Alternatively, you can burn a card from your deck in the flames to get rid of unnecessary baggage and sharpen your strategy.</p></p><br><h1>Swap Cards!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/bf1f001f135062955f8a599764463c04.poster.avif?t=1763458420\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/bf1f001f135062955f8a599764463c04.webm?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/extras/bf1f001f135062955f8a599764463c04.mp4?t=1763458420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap a card from your deck for a new, random card whose rarity is determined at random.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dust &amp; Dice, you build your deck, roll the dice to determine your fate, and battle in turn-based duels that require both skill and luck. Immerse yourself in a world of dusty enemies and dangerous duels, where your luck at the dice table and your strategic acumen determine life and death.</p>","developers":["ByteBuzz Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944240/6726224806cb2a1fd8b06df136284a13fb39126e/header.jpg?t=1763458420","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3944240/1248866164/5922